        "title": "Summary",
        "content": "| Area | Gap Severity | Est. Risk |\n|---|---|---|\n| `errors.ts` unit tests | Medium | Serialization bugs hidden |\n| `mail.ts` `escapeHtml` | High | XSS if HTML escaping broken |\n| `uploads.ts` MIME blocklist | High | Security: executable upload |\n| `conversations.ts` dedup | Medium | Duplicate 1:1 conversations |\n| `org.ts` cascade removal | High | Data leak if cascade silently fails |\n| `notify.ts` self-filter | Low | Notification spam only |\n| `hub.ts` unit tests | Medium | Silent broadcast bugs |\n| Presence lifecycle | Medium | Ghost presence state |\n| App-level error envelope | Medium | API clients get unexpected HTML |\n| Missing policy coverage (CALL/SYSTEM msgs, poll immutability) | High | Client could bypass server-only invariants |\n\nThe highest-priority gaps to address first are the **MIME blocklist tests** (security), **`escapeHtml` XSS coverage** (security), and the **`org.ts` cascade removal tests** (data integrity invariant).",
        "level": 2
      }
    ],
